  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Here <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> has <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>8</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> -configuration with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> as strong ligand.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image5-1c2e85c6-913c-4c3d-9cd1-636c0463697f.jpg\" style=\"width: 455px; height: 599px;\" /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>8</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> -configuration in strong ligand field gives <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>dsp</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> hybridisation, hence square planar geometry.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />Here <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> has <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>8</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> -configuration with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> as weak ligand.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image6-222cef9a-cfe4-44a2-aebf-b55890c65919.jpg\" style=\"width: 408px; height: 594px;\" /><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>-configuration in weak ligand field gives <math><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>hybridisation, hence tetrahedral geometry.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> forms <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math>complex and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is a weak ligand.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image7-eff3c8a6-e971-4955-9763-857f27fe37b1.jpg\" style=\"width: 441px; height: 600px;\" /><br /><br />Therefore, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>has octahedral geometry.<br />In octahedral complexes with <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>8</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> configuration, there is always <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>sp</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msup> <msup> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> hybridisation (outer orbital complex) irrespective of strong ligand field or weak ligand field.",
